'''Mega Ampharos ex''' (Japanese: '''メガデンリュウex''' ''Mega Denryu ex'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 2 {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

